{%- comment -%}
  The stepped-edge motif from Brand Book v2 — the zigzag that runs along page
  edges throughout the book. A traditional textile/temple border redrawn in
  pixel steps, and the strongest single device in the new identity.

  Drawn as an SVG <pattern> so it TILES rather than stretching: one peak repeats
  across whatever width the element is. No viewBox and no preserveAspectRatio —
  stretching would round off the steps and lose the whole point of the motif.

  The band's height is derived from the pattern height rather than passed in.
  They have to match exactly: if the band is taller than one pattern unit a
  second row of peaks bleeds in underneath, which reads as a dense zigzag
  texture instead of a single clean edge.

  Params:
    id     (required) unique per instance. SVG ids collide otherwise, and a
           duplicate silently makes every later band reuse the first colour.
           MUST be pre-assigned — {% render %} does not evaluate filters.
    tone   colour token name, default '--c-purple'
    side   'bottom' (peaks point down into the page, the book's usual) or 'top'
    scale  size of one peak. 1 = 40x20px. Default 3 (120x60), which is roughly
           the proportion the book uses across a slide.

  Usage:
    {%- assign eid = 'hero-top' -%}
    {% render 'gc2-edge', id: eid, tone: '--c-orange', side: 'bottom' %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign tone  = tone  | default: '--c-purple' -%}
{%- assign side  = side  | default: 'bottom' -%}
{%- assign scale = scale | default: 3 -%}

{%- assign unit_w = 40 | times: scale -%}
{%- assign unit_h = 20 | times: scale -%}

{%- comment -%}
  One peak: rises in five 4-unit steps to a point, falls in five. Kept on a
  whole-number grid so the steps stay crisp at any scale.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign step_path = 'M0 20 L0 16 L4 16 L4 12 L8 12 L8 8 L12 8 L12 4 L16 4 L16 0 L20 0 L20 4 L24 4 L24 8 L28 8 L28 12 L32 12 L32 16 L36 16 L36 20 Z' -%}

<svg class="gc2-edge gc2-edge--{{ side }}" width="100%" height="{{ unit_h }}"
     aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation">
  <defs>
    <pattern id="gc2step-{{ id }}" width="{{ unit_w }}" height="{{ unit_h }}" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
      <g transform="scale({{ scale }})">
        <path d="{{ step_path }}" fill="var({{ tone }})"></path>
      </g>
    </pattern>
  </defs>
  <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#gc2step-{{ id }})"></rect>
</svg>
